# A hand-written SMB2 header in its sync form (MS-SMB2 2.2.1.2), a READ
# request's, alone: no body follows. Every field is set and its bytes differ,
# so a field read at another's offset, or in the wrong byte order, reads
# another value. Multi-byte fields are little-endian (MS-SMB2 2.2).
fe 53 4d 42                 # [0,4)   ProtocolId 0xFE 'S' 'M' 'B'
40 00                       # [4,6)   StructureSize 64
02 00                       # [6,8)   CreditCharge 2
03 00 00 00                 # [8,12)  ChannelSequence 3, Reserved 0
08 00                       # [12,14) Command 0x0008, READ
0a 00                       # [14,16) CreditRequest 10
00 00 00 10                 # [16,20) Flags 0x10000000, DFS_OPERATIONS
00 00 00 00                 # [20,24) NextCommand 0: no member follows
01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08     # [24,32) MessageId 0x0807060504030201
ff fe 00 00                 # [32,36) Reserved 0x0000feff
11 12 13 14                 # [36,40) TreeId 0x14131211
21 22 23 24 25 26 27 28     # [40,48) SessionId 0x2827262524232221
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # [48,64) Signature: not signed
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
